# The API base path is automatic — the frontend talks to the backend through
# the reverse proxy using a relative URL (import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "api/").
# In local dev that is `/api/`, proxied to http://localhost:3000 by vite.config.ts.
# In deploy the build receives --base=/projeto-x/ and it becomes `/projeto-x/api/`.
# No VITE_API_URL / VITE_AUTH_URL needed.
